---
// Fruiting Currents — Request A Divination
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0">
    <title>Divination — Fruiting Currents</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400&family=Playfair+Display:ital@1&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>

    <div class="bg-mist"></div>

    <div class="site-wrapper">
        
        <header class="main-header">
            <a href="/" class="header-back-link">Fruiting Currents</a>
        </header>

        <main class="content-flow">
            
            <section class="page-intro">
                <h1>Divination Sessions</h1>
                <div class="divider"></div>
            </section>

            <section class="narrative-block">
                <p class="body-text">
                    Divination is a collaborative look into the structural currents of a moment. Utilizing symbolic card imagery, mythic cycles, and traditional frameworks, these consultations offer a space to look beneath immediate noise and identify core patterns.
                </p>
                <p class="body-text">
                    Whether navigating personal transformations, structural blocks within a creative project, or seeking clarity during transitional seasons, we look at the imagery to orient your direction.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="action-node">
                <h3 class="session-title">Symbolic Imagery Consulting</h3>
                <span class="session-meta">60 Minutes — Private Session</span>
                
                <a href="#booking-calendar-link" class="booking-button">Book a Session</a>
            </section>

        </main>

    </div>

</body>
</html>

<style>
    /* Reset & Base System */
    * { 
        box-sizing: border-box; 
        margin: 0; 
        padding: 0; 
    }
    
    html, body {
        background-color: #f6f3f0;
        color: #2a2825;
        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        overflow-x: hidden; 
        width: 100%;
        -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    }

    body {
        position: relative;
    }

    .bg-mist {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        right: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 15%, rgba(213, 226, 235, 0.4) 0%, rgba(243, 215, 215, 0.35) 50%, rgba(246, 243, 240, 0) 100%);
        z-index: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    .site-wrapper {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        max-width: 460px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 5rem 1.25rem 8rem 1.25rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
    }

    /* Main Brand Header linked back to Home */
    .main-header {
        width: 100%;
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 5rem; 
    }

    .header-back-link {
        font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
        font-weight: 400;
        font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 5vw, 1.8rem);
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #8c857b; /* Slightly muted tone to show it's a navigational back link */
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: color 0.3s ease;
        display: inline-block;
    }

    .header-back-link:hover {
        color: #2a2825; /* Sharpens to deep black-brown on hover */
    }

    /* Content Stream Layout */
    .content-flow {
        width: 100%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 3.5rem;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .page-intro h1 {
        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        font-style: italic;
        font-weight: 400;
        font-size: 2rem;
        color: #2a2825;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .divider {
        width: 35px;
        height: 1px;
        background-color: #e2ded9;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .narrative-block {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .body-text {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #5a534a;
        font-weight: 300;
        text-align: justify; /* Editorial text-alignment */
        text-align-last: center;
    }

    /* Interactive Booking Element */
    .action-node {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        border: 1px solid rgba(226, 222, 217, 0.6);
        padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 2px;
        margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .session-title {
        font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #3a3530;
        margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .session-meta {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: #8c857b;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 300;
    }

    .booking-button {
        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        color: #f6f3f0;
        background-color: #3a3530;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
        border-radius: 2px;
        transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
        display: inline-block;
    }

    .booking-button:hover {
        background-color: #5a534a;
    }

    @media (max-width: 400px) {
        .site-wrapper {
            padding-top: 3.5rem;
            padding-bottom: 6rem;
        }
        .main-header {
            margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
        }
    }
</style>